# Build context hygiene. The backend image copies only app/, scripts/,
# tests/, alembic/ and requirements.txt, but an unfiltered context still
# ships .venv, node_modules and the vector store to the daemon on every
# build.
#
# Named Dockerfile.dockerignore, not .dockerignore: the build context is the
# repository root while the Dockerfile lives here in docker/, and BuildKit
# looks for <dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile before falling
# back to .dockerignore at the context root. Renaming this file, or moving it
# away from docker/Dockerfile, silently restores the unfiltered context.

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/

# Runtime state - bind-mounted by compose, never baked into the image.
chroma_db/
chunks.json
sample_problems.json
data/

# Secrets. Injected via compose env_file at run time, not build time.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
*.md
Untitled-*.algo
